Exploded in “The Pet and Its Drone” tandem David Lowry and screenwriter Toby Halbrucks entered a new ambitious project about an ungrown boy according to James Barry’s eponymous fairy-tale.
RBC journalist Alexander Sokolov will be presented with a new accusation
The lawyers of the RBC journalist Alexander Sokolov, accused of organizing the activities of an extremist structure, stated that the Prosecutor’s office found flaws in the case of their client.
The fact that the Prosecutor's office made such an idea, we learned from the investigators just yesterday.
We were planned to participate in the court session on the issue of restriction of familiarization with the materials of the criminal case, but the meeting in the end did not take place, and the investigators informed us about the submission made by the prosecutor’s office, ”said Olga Dinze's lawyer.
She said that the Prosecutor’s office pointed out to the investigators the inconsistencies of the qualification of the case and the collected materials.
Now the investigators will have to eliminate the gaps in the Evidentilitory Base and bring Alexander Sokolov a new accusation.
Either in the case there will be a other article of the Criminal code (CC), or will remain the same, but with other arguments and new evillages, says Ms. Dinze said.
Alexander Sokolov was arrested on July 29, 2015
In June of this year, it was reported that the investigation sanitized from the accusation of the RBC journalist a formulation of “staggering the political situation in the direction of instability” and “overthrewing the government by illegal means”.
