In Miass (Chelyabinsk region) detained the lawyer of the former vice-governor Nikolay Sandakov Konstantin Akulich.
According to "Kommersant-Yuzhny Ural" another lawyer of the accused - Sergei Kolosovsky, Konstantin Akulich today was summoned to the investigative department of the Miass Tsrore to bring charges in the case of a year of limitation about beating.
Then Konstantin Akulich went to the place of the accident as a lawyer to help one of its participants.
"Initially it was initiated against unidentified persons. Now, when he began to defend Nikolay Sandakov, it turned out that it was Akulich," Sergei Kolostovsky said.
Konstantin Akulich became the lawyer of the ex-deputy of the governor in the beginning of August.
At the same time, half an hour before the lawyer was summoned in the TFR, Miass the defense was notified that the deadline for familiarizing himself with the cases of the case of the freak that Nikolai Sandakov was accused of was expiring.
We will remind, two criminal cases have been initiated against Nikolay Sandakov.
Within the framework of the first (the case of fraud), he is charged with a promise for 1.5 million rubles. to facilitate the appointment to the post of mayor of Magnitogorsk the head of the administration of Ozersk Yevgeny Tarasov.
The second criminal case relates to a bribe that Nikolay Sandakov allegedly received from the director of the PSC “Pyton” Igor Kalugin in the form of illegal gratuitous provision of services of a property nature in the amount of not less than 1.3 million.
