The military of the black sea fleet carried out the development of actions on anti-submarine sabotage defense in the waters of the Black Sea.
RIA Novosti was reported by the representative of the press service of the Ministry of Defense for the Naval Navy Igor Dygalo.
The exercises were carried out as part of the first stage of the exercises on special types of ensuring the actions of naval forces.
“Militaries of the anti-submarine sabotage units worked out an anti-submarine and sabotage defense of the missile-launch of fleet forces on a part of the coast and the adjoining maritime area of the Black Sea," Dygalo said.
The exercises were attended by about 400 servicemen, more than 10 units of military equipment, including Mi-8 and Ka-27 helicopters, anti-sabotage Boats "Raptor".
In the course of the manoeuvring maneuvers, the forces of the exchange ships with the use of hydraulic acoustics were found conditional sabotage groups and repelled the attack of “substantial saboteurs” from the side of the sea on the basis of the BSF forces.
From the Ka-27 helicopter, an amphibious assault group disembarked, which blocked and destroyed saboteurs of a conditional enemy.
After that, sprumercials of the Black Sea Fleet went to the sea to search for mines.
Dygalo said that "the these exercises of the Black Sea Fleet are carried out in accordance with the idea of the preparation and carrying out the upcoming Kavkaz-2016 command-and-staff exercise and a plan for the preparation of the Navy."
From July 18 to July 30, Ukraine and the United States held a joint military exercise Sea Breeze 2016 navy in the Black Sea.
In total, about four thousand people from 16 countries took part in the maneuvers.
The marine component involved more than 25 ships, boats and support ships of the United States, Turkey, Romania and Ukraine.
The court in the Moscow region arrested the father for the murder of the adopted daughter: Investigation and the court: law enforcement agencies: Lenta.ru
Ozersky city court of the Moscow region authorized the arrest of Roman Chernikov, who confessed to the murder of his six-year-old adopted daughter.
About it on Thursday, August 11, according to the city news agency “Moscow”, said the press Secretary of the court Nina Zhilkina.
“The court satisfied the request of the investigating authorities to elect a preventive measure against Chernivt in the form of detention for two months”, – she said. – she said.
Chernivtsi will be under arrest until October 9.
On August 11, the TFR in the Moscow region reported that the adoptive parents and the grandparent of a six-year-Lithuanian girl gave a confession in her murder.
In particular, Roman Cherninikov said that he committed the murder of the child on one of the days of April 2016 from personal hostile relations, being at home in a state of alcoholic intoxication.
Then, in order to hide the child's body, he burned it and scattered the remains with his wife in a large area.
In the evening of August 9 during an interrogation at the investigator, adoptive parents reported that a six-year-old child drowned in a bath in April 2016.
For a long time they were able to hide the disappearance of the girl from everyone, but in August, after learning that they should soon come to their home, decided to say to everyone that the child was missing.
The parents claimed that on August 6 of the year their adoptive daughter arbitrarily resigned from the site of the house, where they lived their family and disappeared.
Pope Francis has celebrating a Syrian refugee trepidation in the Vatican.
About it on Thursday, August 11, said the head of the press service of the Holy Throne Greg Burke, reports CTV News.
Migrants arrived at the invitation of the pontiff from the Greek island of Lesvos.
Lunch took place in the Vaquican House of Hagia Martha, where the personal apartments of Francis are located.
It is noted that the meal was attended by two groups of Syrian refugees, which on April 16 was visited by a pontiff in Greece on April 16.
Then on the way back to the Vatican, he took on board his plane 12 migrants, including six children.
In June, the second group of Syrians arrived.
The Holy Threat took care of them.
“Dad brought the toys and gifts to the children in response, they in response gave him their children and the adults were able today to talk with the Pontiff about the first days of their lives in Italy,” Burke said.
During his April visit, the pope called the migratory crisis that erupted in Europe in 2015, “the biggest disaster since the Second World War.”
“Crise is one of the countries through which most migrants get to Europe.
According to the Greek authorities, in 2015, a total of 800 thousand people traveled from Turkey to neighboring islands in the Aegean.
At the same time, Lesvos has become the main transit point for refugees on the way to the EU.
Correts with a length of more than 40 kilometers were formed in Japan on the first day of short-term summer holidays.
About it on Thursday, August 11, according to the information center of road traffic of the country, RIA Novosti reports.
So, in the area of the Prefecture of Totiga, the traffic jam has stretched for 43 kilometers, Kanagawa Prefecture - for 33 kilometers.
As noted by the agency, the trains are overcrowded twice, air tickets in domestic directions are completely sold out.
Since August 11, 2016 in Japan celebrates Mountain Day, the feast is officially considered a day off.
After that, many of the Japanese for a few days go to their native cities.
A short vacation among the Japanese will last at least until Tuesday next week, then a new peak of traffic congestion is expected.
In Japan it is considered a bad tone to take a full vacation.
According to the law, the subjects are allowed to rest for 18 days a year, but the majority of them are limited for a week.
