The pensioner turned the ladder into a “budget beach tower”.
Users of the network laughed about the photos in which an elderly man installed a girdle on the beach and turned it into a springboard for junction into a diving.
The picture was published on several entertainment portals, as well as in the group “My Taganrog” in the social network “Vkontakte”, because of which many decided that the photo was taken on the coast of the Sea of Azov.
In the comments "innovation" dubbed a "budget tower" and "mobile springboard".
Many praised the man for ingenuity and “sweetness”, and some drew attention to the fact that the man is seriously injured when jumping from his tower, since he installed it at insufficient depth.
However, one of the comedians on Pikabu portal noted that it is impossible to judicate the depth of the sea by a picture.
“First, we don’t know what the depth is there, the beach can be as bulk with abrupt descent per meter right behind the stairs, and secondly, even if there is a meter of depth, with proper aknowledgment you can jump from a couple of meters,” wrote the user under the nickname C0JIbaMDDJZ
