In the middle of the frenziness of the Olympian Games - "Zen" trampoline voyages
No matter how long it is, it’s an Olympia.
Events in Rio de Janeiro seem immutable and unavoidable, it is a frenzied combination of competition and aspiration.
It's like an Olympian flame itself is the burning torch, which is transmitted from the wizard to the swimmer, to a gymnastic, to a triathlete.
