Dooley, who participates for the first time in the Olympic Games, a handsome with dimples on the cheeks, could well be among those celebrities who are shown in the prime-time, who are promoted by sponsors and life-affirming clicharies if he was a swimmer, a gymnast or even a fencing worker.
