Here I have to admit that I'm not an expert, it's just an enthusiast-based enthusiast.
They really have a comic potential - it's a caric triffusion of unfinished voyages - but also the elegance of gymnastics and diving, the two kinds of sports, which they mostly combine in themselves.
The word "trap" comes from the Spanish word "el trampolín", which means "trump for diving".
