“Football and ad blockers unleashed an arms race”
The recent implementation of Facebook technology, which prevented the shaking of advertising on the pages of the social network, provoked the developers of solutions to block advertising for responsible actions.
AdBlock Plus released an “anti-easode”, but Facebook plans to soon make it useless.
So AdBlock Plus has advertised its new technology, which is most likely to remain uneasatisfied
