In Facebook expressed deplored this policy of AdBlock AdBlock Plus and promised to quickly resolve the problem.
As told a source among the developers of the social network publication TechCrunch, the code that makes AdBlock Plus is useless on the desktop Facebook website will be ready within the coming hours.
Thus, the social network and blockers unleashed a kind of “emergooting race”, trying to beat each other, users who missed interesting entourages from their friends or have seen an advertisement where they are not accustomed to see it.
