Rich New is equipped with two engines to a choice: petrol 2.4 l (137 hp) or turbodiesel of 2.5 liters (116 hp).
The gearbox - only mechanics, the actuator - on the rear wheels, but there are modifications with a rigidly connected "front".
There will be a new flagship A9 sediment at the Dongfeng booth, its Russian premiere was annominated the representative office of the Chinese company back in June in June.
There are more and more mining-like crossovers in the Chinese market, one of the most recent novelties - Cowin V3 and SWM X7.
At the present time, the Russian Dongffeng linement consists of two models: the S30 sedan and the H30 Cross hatchback.
For the first seven months of this year, the dealers of the Chinese company sold 696 cars in our country.
Notifications for the transport tax will cease to be sent by post - site Driving www.zr.ru
The tax inspectorate has changed the procedure for dissimbising notifications of property taxes.
All Russian car holders are accustomed to the scheme not unchanged for years: in the summer and autumn they receive by the mail a receipt for the payment of the transport tax for the previous year.
However, this year many will not be able to wait for them.
The fact is the fact that the tax inspectorate without unnecessary noise has changed the procedure for notifying citizens.
To those who are registered in the "Personal account of the taxpayer" on the official website of nalog.ru, the notifications will come in electronic form.
In the inspection, the inspection automatically considered such Russians online users and crossed them out of a standard, “paperable” newsletter.
The innovation will affect all owners of vehicles and real estate.
All others will continue to receive the usual letters.
However, there is an opportunity to return to an old diagram for the owners of an account on the site.
To do this, they will have to visit the tax office during August and write a statement.
On the one hand, the new order is more continual and more comfortable.
The notification will appear in the "personal account" immediately after drawing up, while the letter will last for a few days and it may be completely lost.
In Addition, the number of users of the Internet service of the tax inspectorate exceeded 18 million people, which will allow the agency to seriously save on the postal newsletter.
On the other hand, the humble news on the website of the inspection is clearly not not enough to inform citizens about a changed order.
Some could register in a “personal account” to receive a one-time one-time service and have long forgotten about it.
These people will do not wait for notifications in the mail and, without realizing it, will fall into the category of non-payers with all the ensuing consequences.
Access to "Personal account of the taxpayer" is carried out in three ways: through the account of the portal gouslugi.ru, with the help of an electronic signature or installation of a login and password specified in the registration card.
The latter can be obtained in person in any branch of the tax inspectorate (regardless of the place of registration).
We will remind you that in this year the transport tax must be paid before December 1.
Sending notifications began in July.
